  "notes": "{捧|ささ}げる is an ichidan verb meaning to offer or devote something with sincerity or reverence.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n\nFUNCTIONS:\n1. To offer (physically or ceremonially): holding something up as an offering\n2. To devote (figuratively): dedicating time, life, or effort\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{祈|いの}り→祈り：13732_inori⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{捧|ささ}げる: to offer prayers\n- ⟦{人生|じんせい}→人生：03355_jinsei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{捧|ささ}げる: to devote one's life\n- ⟦{敬意|けいい}→敬意：02781_keii⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{捧|ささ}げる: to pay respect\n- ⟦{黙祷|もくとう}→黙祷：17408_mokutou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{捧|ささ}げる: to observe a moment of silence\n- ⟦{愛|あい}→愛：02370_ai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{捧|ささ}げる: to dedicate one's love\n\nREGISTER:\nOften used in formal, literary, or ceremonial contexts.",
